OL,3,AMacron calls for calm in France and
OL,4,Awarns rioting must not escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,7,Fcalled for "calm and order" and warned
OL,8,Friots across the country must not
OL,9,Fescalate, during a national television
OL,10,Faddress.
OL,12,FSpeaking from the Elysee Palace in
OL,13,FParis, the president said "we all feel
OL,14,Fanger and shame" after a major day of
OL,15,Fprotests turned into rioting and
OL,16,Flooting across France on Saturday.
OL,18,FSome 550,000 demonstrators took to the
OL,19,Fstreets for largely peaceful protests
OL,20,Fagainst rising fuel prices, the cost of
OL,21,Fliving and deteriorating public
OL,22,Fservices, including schools.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
